   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Okr&#xfa;hly st&#xf4;l V4 k reforme verejnej spr&#xe1;vy - Vyslanie experta</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">V4 roundtable on the reform of public administration - Sending an expert</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Okr&#xfa;hly st&#xf4;l z&#xe1;stupcov ministrov kraj&#xed;n V4 a&#xa0;UA s&#xa0;expertmi v&#xa0;oblasti decentraliz&#xe1;cie &#x161;t&#xe1;tnej samospr&#xe1;vy a&#xa0;jej rozvoja bude sl&#xfa;&#x17e;i&#x165; ako &#x10f;al&#x161;&#xed; krok v prehlbovan&#xed; poznatkov ukrajinsk&#xfd;ch expertov v&#xa0;oblasti decentraliz&#xe1;cie &#x161;t&#xe1;tnej samospr&#xe1;vy. Ich poznatky bud&#xfa; m&#xf4;c&#x165; by&#x165; n&#xe1;sledne vyu&#x17e;it&#xe9; v r&#xe1;mci vlastn&#xe9;ho procesu zav&#xe1;dzania reforiem a nadobudnut&#xe9; sk&#xfa;senosti ukrajinsk&#xfd;ch partnerov m&#xf4;&#x17e;u by&#x165; rovnako vyu&#x17e;it&#xe9; aj v r&#xe1;mci pokra&#x10d;ovania reforiem v&#xa0;&#x10f;al&#x161;&#xed;ch &#xfa;zemn&#xfd;ch oblastiach UA&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Round Table of Ministers of the V4 countries and UA experts in the field of decentralization of state administration and its development will serve as a further step in deepening knowledge of Ukrainian experts in the field of decentralization of state administration. Their knowledge&#xa0;can&#xa0;be used within the actual process of implementation of reforms and lessons learned Ukrainian partners can also be used also during the continuation of reforms in other areas of territorial UA&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org ref="XM-DAC-69-2" role="2" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">p. Pavol Deme&#x161; - zahrani&#x10d;nopolitick&#xfd; analytik</narrative>
  </participating-org>
